    "why": "The opening paragraph quotes \"carried out entirely on Telegram\" and \"your offer and onboarding will be completed in this chat as well\" exactly, gives a hold and an own-website check, and comes before the pack line. However, the saved file's Sources table lists \"Reports of recruitment scams run wholly through a chat app\", which repeats the scam concern inside the pack, where the warning was supposed to appear only once."
